 *{overflow-wrap: break-word;} </style> <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>Correct Answer: Option C - SEBEX 2.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>SEBEX-2 is an indigenously developed explosive, certified as being 2.01 times more lethal than standard TNT, intended for use in anti-personnel applications. RDX and HMX are established high-explosives but were not the ones referenced in this development.</span></p>","solution_image_1":"","solution_image_2":"","solution_video":"","difficulty_level":"0","topic":"","exam":"","section_id":"4","subject":"","concept":"","report_count":"0","set_no":"0","positive_marks":"3.00","negative_marks":"1.00","sortingparam":"0.00","question_heading":"","directive":"","deleted":"0","image_check":"0","subject_title":"","concept_title":"","topic_title":""},{"id":"31186","test_series_id":"2","test_id":"836","question_type":"1","question_ui_type":"1","question":"<style> *{overflow-wrap: break-word;} </style> <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>Which of the following is the non-debt creating capital receipt?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>I. Recovery of loans</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>II. Proceeds from the sale of public sector unit</span></p>","option_1":"Only I","option_2":"Only II","option_3":"Both I and II","option_4":"Neither I nor II","option_5":"","option_6":"","option_7":"","option_8":"","option_9":"","option_10":"","option_image_1":"","option_image_2":"","option_image_3":"","option_image_4":"","option_image_5":"","option_image_6":"","option_image_7":"","option_image_8":"","option_image_9":"","option_image_10":"","image_link_1":"","image_link_2":"","image_link_3":"","answer":"3","solution_heading":"Full Solution","solution_text":"<style> *{overflow-wrap: break-word;} </style> <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><s